 "nodes": {
  "training": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So Isolde sent me another one. Good. Mind the sparks. Marta Ironvein, smith to the Wardens.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.training_0",
     "ticks": 148,
     "beats": [
      30,
      600,
      1160,
      1720,
      2670,
      3540,
      4550,
      5110,
      5760,
      6360,
      6920
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Out there, things hit hard and they don't take turns. So you'll learn two things before you leave my yard.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.training_1",
     "ticks": 141,
     "beats": [
      30,
      610,
      1250,
      1830,
      2740,
      3370,
      4270,
      4850,
      5430,
      6010,
      6580
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "First, the roll. Tap the dodge key, Left Alt unless you've changed it, and you'll roll clear. For a breath, nothing can touch you.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.training_2",
     "ticks": 180,
     "beats": [
      0,
      880,
      1970,
      2660,
      3540,
      4230,
      5070,
      5770,
      6870,
      7800,
      8490
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Second, the parry. Raise a shield, or your blade, the instant before a blow lands, and it'll bounce right back at them.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.training_3",
     "ticks": 156,
     "beats": [
      30,
      770,
      1820,
      2400,
      3130,
      4010,
      4600,
      5190,
      5960,
      6570,
      7280
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The dummy in the yard swings slow and honest. Roll under one swing, then parry the next. Go on.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.training_4",
     "ticks": 130,
     "cue": "impatient",
     "beats": [
      20,
      550,
      1070,
      1600,
      2120,
      2980,
      3500,
      4030,
      4660,
      5590,
      6110
     ]
    }
   ],
   "do": [
    "complete:meet_marta"
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Right.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "hint_dodge": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Roll. When the dummy swings, tap dodge and get out from under it. Don't think. Roll.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.hint_dodge_0",
     "ticks": 128,
     "beats": [
      30,
      540,
      1360,
      1860,
      2480,
      2980,
      3480,
      4310,
      4830,
      5450,
      5950
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "hint_parry": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now the parry. Block the instant before it hits. Too early and you're just holding a shield. Too late and you're holding your nose.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.hint_parry_0",
     "ticks": 159,
     "cue": "dryly",
     "beats": [
      30,
      660,
      1660,
      2290,
      3250,
      3880,
      4510,
      5520,
      6150,
      6840,
      7460
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "meet": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Mind the sparks. Marta Ironvein, smith to the Wardens.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.meet_0",
     "ticks": 82,
     "beats": [
      20,
      350,
      670,
      1010,
      1610,
      1930,
      2260,
      2640,
      2970,
      3290,
      3610
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The beasts out here grow strange parts. Bring them to me with a few Marks, and I'll make you something worth swinging.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.meet_1",
     "ticks": 132,
     "beats": [
      30,
      620,
      1160,
      1700,
      2330,
      3310,
      3870,
      4430,
      4970,
      5520,
      6090
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Show me what you make.",
     "go": "#shop"
    },
    {
     "text": "What can those parts become?",
     "go": "parts"
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "greet": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Back for steel? Good. Steel's always the answer. Usually.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.greet_0",
     "ticks": 96,
     "cue": "beat",
     "beats": [
      20,
      390,
      750,
      1350,
      1850,
      2210,
      2580,
      2940,
      3300,
      4030,
      4390
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Show me what you make.",
     "go": "#shop"
    },
    {
     "text": "What can those parts become?",
     "go": "parts"
    },
    {
     "text": "Can a weapon grow stronger?",
     "go": "forge_offer",
     "if": [
      "!side:forge:started",
      "chapter>=1"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "parts": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ember cores from the ashen husks make a blade that burns. Crystal from the shardlings sings when you swing it.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.parts_0",
     "ticks": 132,
     "beats": [
      30,
      590,
      1130,
      1680,
      2310,
      3020,
      3930,
      4470,
      5020,
      5560,
      6180
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Lurker fangs make a hook that drags, gear springs a maul that kicks, rime cores a spear that bites cold. Bring me the pieces.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.parts_1",
     "ticks": 179,
     "beats": [
      30,
      750,
      1500,
      2360,
      3240,
      4030,
      5070,
      5830,
      6720,
      7790,
      8470
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Show me what you make.",
     "go": "#shop"
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "forge_offer": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "That blade of yours has some miles on it. Weapons remember, out here. Every fight. Every kill. Some of them start to want more.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_offer_0",
     "ticks": 170,
     "beats": [
      20,
      720,
      1400,
      2480,
      3160,
      4040,
      4730,
      5630,
      6700,
      7380,
      8060
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Bring me a weapon that's ready to wake, and the parts it asks for, and we'll see what it wants to become. You'll swing the hammer, mind. I don't do all the work.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_offer_1",
     "ticks": 177,
     "beats": [
      30,
      760,
      1490,
      2360,
      3140,
      4140,
      4870,
      6010,
      6740,
      7640,
      8390
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "How will I know it's ready?",
     "go": "forge_ready",
     "do": [
      "side:forge:start"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "I'll be back.",
     "go": "#end",
     "do": [
      "side:forge:start"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "forge_ready": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "When it's ready, it hums. You'll see it in the journal, and on the blade. Then bring it here with what it asks for.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_ready_0",
     "ticks": 136,
     "beats": [
      30,
      570,
      1240,
      2080,
      2610,
      3140,
      3710,
      4650,
      5180,
      5730,
      6310
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "forge_progress": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "No hum yet. Keep fighting. Weapons are like people. They grow when they're used.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_progress_0",
     "ticks": 110,
     "beats": [
      10,
      440,
      870,
      1470,
      2230,
      2650,
      3080,
      3760,
      4190,
      4620,
      5040
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Show me what you make.",
     "go": "#shop"
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "forge_smith": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It's humming. I can hear it from here. To the anvil, then.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_smith_0",
     "ticks": 73,
     "beats": [
      20,
      310,
      600,
      970,
      1260,
      1540,
      1830,
      2400,
      2690,
      2980,
      3260
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Strike when the metal glows gold. Not before. Not after. And keep your fingers where I can see them.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_smith_1",
     "ticks": 133,
     "cue": "grins",
     "beats": [
      20,
      570,
      1120,
      1690,
      2440,
      3100,
      3670,
      4520,
      5070,
      5620,
      6160
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "To the anvil.",
     "go": "#end",
     "do": [
      "minigame:smithing"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Not yet.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "forge_done": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "There. Feel the weight change? That's not the steel. That's the weapon deciding it likes you.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_done_0",
     "ticks": 119,
     "beats": [
      30,
      730,
      1190,
      1650,
      2390,
      2850,
      3640,
      4100,
      4560,
      5020,
      5480
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Bring me any weapon that hums, any time. The anvil's yours.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.marta.forge_done_1",
     "ticks": 88,
     "beats": [
      20,
      380,
      740,
      1100,
      1460,
      1930,
      2290,
      2650,
      3250,
      3610,
      3970
     ]
    }
   ],
   "do": [
